32.8,11577.5,11983.9,12351.5,12680.2,12970.5,13223.2,13439.4,13620.3,13767.4,13882.1,13966.2,14021.3,14049.0,14051.1,14029.3,13985.2,13920.3,14416.2,14984.7,15556.2,16130.6,16707.8,17287.5,17869.6,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4,17870.4]},"events":[{"id":"dc-siting-revolt","year":2027.9,"layer":"economy","text":"Data-center siting revolts spread across states and provinces; power, water and grid politics constrain the build-out map.","cites":["concepts/compute-governance"]},{"id":"natsec-merge","year":2027.9,"layer":"geopolitics","text":"Washington effectively merges frontier development into a national program; clearances, SCIFs and DPA authorities arrive.","cites":["sources/aschenbrenner-situational-awareness"]},{"id":"bubble-correction","year":2028.5,"layer":"economy","text":"The AI capex complex corrects sharply; valuations reset while physical build-out survives.","cites":["analysis/ai-bubble-vs-buildout","concepts/ai-bubble-debate"]},{"id":"prosperity-fund","year":2028.6,"layer":"politics","text":"A Shared-AI-Prosperity-style sovereign fund, financed by an inference-compute tax, moves from white paper to bill in 2028.","cites":["sources/2028-global-intelligence-crisis"]},{"id":"lead-lock","year":2028.6,"layer":"geopolitics","text":"Export-loophole closure and distillation deterrence lock in a 12-24 month democratic capability lead, per the four-fronts playbook.","cites":["sources/anthropic-2028-ai-leadership"]},{"id":"sc-crossing","year":2029.0,"layer":"capability","text":"Frontier systems cross the superhuman-coder line; AI-run engineering teams become the norm at leading labs.","cites":["sources/ai-2027","concepts/agi-timelines"]},{"id":"copyright-settles","year":2029.1,"layer":"law","text":"The copyright question reaches doctrine: appellate rulings settle training-data liability into a licensing regime.","cites":["analysis/ai-copyright-litigation","litigation/nyt-v-openai"]},{"id":"election-realign","year":2032.6,"layer":"politics","text":"AI becomes a first-order electoral axis; anti-AI and abundance-AI factions reorganize coalitions in the 2032 cycle.","cites":["concepts/ai-backlash","sources/europe-2031"]},{"id":"labor-constitution","year":2033.5,"layer":"labor","text":"Work's social contract is renegotiated: wage insurance, flexicurity variants, and the first serious dividend schemes.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption","sources/europe-2031"]},{"id":"robot-economy","year":2043.5,"layer":"economy","text":"Special economic zones with AI planners and dense robotics begin doubling output on multi-year timescales.","cites":["sources/ai-2027"]},{"id":"digital-minds","year":2045.9,"layer":"far","text":"Digital persons hold legal standing in several jurisdictions; population statistics grow a second column.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]},{"id":"space-industrial","year":2065.4,"layer":"far","text":"Industrial mass in cislunar space passes terrestrial thresholds; the solar economy stops being a metaphor.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a","sources/ai-2027"]},{"id":"post-work-constitution","year":2076.2,"layer":"far","text":"A generation raised after wage-labor's centrality writes new institutions for status, contribution and time.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption","sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"layers":{"economy":[{"year":2029,"text":"Post-correction: valuations reset, weak credit cleared, the physical build-out running \u2014 growth resumes on sounder footing.","cites":["concepts/ai-bubble-debate"]},{"year":2044,"text":"Whatever the 2020s broke or built, mid-century output is dominated by AI-run production; the argument is allocation.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"labor":[{"year":2029,"text":"Split labor market: augmented professions pull ahead, exposed ones hollow; geography and sector decide who feels which future.","cites":["concepts/ai-displacement-vs-augmentation"]},{"year":2049,"text":"Work as identity loosens: dividend schemes, contribution economies, and the post-work constitution debates.","cites":["concepts/ai-labor-disruption"]}],"law":[{"year":2029,"text":"Security law: classification regimes, export criminalization, cleared-personnel rules \u2014 administrative law bends around the national program.","cites":["sources/aschenbrenner-situational-awareness"]},{"year":2044,"text":"Personhood at the bar: digital minds, AI counsel, and liability for autonomous systems define the mid-century docket.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"geopolitics":[{"year":2029,"text":"Lead-lock politics: the four-fronts doctrine governs alliances; allies choose stacks, not sides.","cites":["sources/anthropic-2028-ai-leadership"]},{"year":2049,"text":"Power follows compute and its energy; the map of capability is the map of leverage.","cites":["concepts/compute-governance"]}],"public":[{"year":2029,"text":"Backlash governs: anti-AI coalitions win real elections; siting, schooling and surveillance fights set the tone.","cites":["concepts/ai-backlash"]},{"year":2049,"text":"A generation raised with minds-on-tap; the meaning politics the far field keeps on the table.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]}],"science":[{"year":2034,"text":"The compressed century opens: AI-driven biology clears disease families ahead of trend; materials and climate tech follow.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace"]},{"year":2059,"text":"The frontier is nonhuman: discovery outpaces comprehension, and translation becomes its own discipline.","cites":["sources/ai-2040-plan-a"]}],"climate":[{"year":2029,"text":"The power bill arrives: AI load grows toward hundreds of TWh; gas bridges, nuclear restarts, and grid politics decide the emissions path.","cites":["industries/energy","concepts/compute-governance"]},{"year":2041,"text":"The payback test: AI-designed energy tech (fusion bets, grid optimization, materials) begins repaying the build-out's carbon debt.","cites":["sources/machines-of-loving-grace","industries/energy"]},{"year":2059,"text":"Climate outcomes track governance more than compute: the decisive variable was always deployment speed of what the science found.","cites":["industries/energy"]}]}}